  <diagram name="Trang-3" id="x5HQlPj2_JuzqSuxAucQ">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml Class_Diagram_QuanLyVanPhong\n\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; CAU HINH GIAO DIEN\n&#39; ========================================\n\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam backgroundColor White\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\nskinparam classAttributeIconSize 0\nskinparam ClassBackgroundColor White\nskinparam ClassBorderColor #C34B68\nskinparam ClassFontColor #202020\nskinparam ArrowColor #B94B65\n\nskinparam nodesep 45\nskinparam ranksep 60\n\nhide circle\nhide empty members\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 1. QUAN LY TANG VA PHONG\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass Tang {\n  maTang: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  tenTang: String\n  moTa: String\n}\n\nclass Phong {\n  maPhong: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maTang: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maSoPhong: String\n  huong: String\n  dienTich: double\n  donGiaThue: decimal\n  tinhTrang: String\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 2. QUAN LY KHACH HANG VA CONG TY\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass KhachHang {\n  maKhachHang: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  hoTen: String\n  soDienThoai: String\n  email: String\n  diaChi: String\n}\n\nclass CongTyThue {\n  maCongTy: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  tenCongTy: String\n  maSoThue: String\n  diaChi: String\n  soDienThoai: String\n  email: String\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 3. QUAN LY HOP DONG\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass HopDong {\n  maHopDong: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maKhachHang: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maCongTy: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayLap: Date\n  ngayBatDau: Date\n  ngayKetThuc: Date\n  tongTienThue: decimal\n  trangThai: String\n}\n\nclass ChiTietHopDong {\n  maChiTiet: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maHopDong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maPhong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  donGiaThue: decimal\n  thoiHanThue: int\n}\n\nclass PhieuGiaHan {\n  maPhieuGiaHan: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maHopDong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayGiaHan: Date\n  thoiGianGiaHan: int\n  ngayKetThucMoi: Date\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 4. THANH TOAN TIEN THUE\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass ThanhToanTienThue {\n  maThanhToan: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maHopDong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayThanhToan: Date\n  soTien: decimal\n  kyThanhToan: String\n  phuongThuc: String\n  trangThai: String\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 5. QUAN LY DICH VU\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass LoaiDichVu {\n  maDichVu: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  tenDichVu: String\n  donGia: decimal\n  donViTinh: String\n}\n\nclass HoaDonDichVu {\n  maHoaDon: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maHopDong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayLap: Date\n  thangThanhToan: String\n  tongTien: decimal\n  trangThai: String\n}\n\nclass ChiTietHoaDonDichVu {\n  maChiTiet: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maHoaDon: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maDichVu: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maPhong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  chiSoCu: double\n  chiSoMoi: double\n  soLuongSuDung: double\n  thanhTien: decimal\n}\n\nclass ThanhToanDichVu {\n  maThanhToan: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maHoaDon: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayThanhToan: Date\n  soTien: decimal\n  phuongThuc: String\n  trangThai: String\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 6. QUAN LY NHAN VIEN CONG TY\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass NhanVienCongTy {\n  maNhanVien: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maCongTy: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maPhong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  hoTen: String\n  hinhAnh: String\n  chucVu: String\n  ngayVaoLam: Date\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 7. QUAN LY THE GIU XE\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass TheGiuXe {\n  maThe: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maNhanVien: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maPhuongTien: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayCap: Date\n  trangThai: String\n}\n\nclass PhuongTien {\n  maPhuongTien: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  bienSoXe: String\n  loaiXe: String\n  mauXe: String\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 8. KIEM TRA PHONG VA VI PHAM\n&#39; ========================================\n\nclass KiemTraPhong {\n  maKiemTra: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maPhong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayKiemTra: Date\n  noiDung: String\n  ketQua: String\n}\n\nclass BienBanViPham {\n  maBienBan: int &lt;&lt;PK&gt;&gt;\n  maPhong: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  maKiemTra: int &lt;&lt;FK&gt;&gt;\n  ngayLap: Date\n  noiDungViPham: String\n  mucPhat: decimal\n  trangThai: String\n}\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 9. BO CUC CAC LOP\n&#39; ========================================\n\nTang -[hidden]down- Phong\n\nKhachHang -[hidden]right- CongTyThue\nCongTyThue -[hidden]down- HopDong\n\nHopDong -[hidden]down- ChiTietHopDong\nChiTietHopDong -[hidden]down- PhieuGiaHan\n\nPhieuGiaHan -[hidden]down- ThanhToanTienThue\n\nLoaiDichVu -[hidden]down- ChiTietHoaDonDichVu\n\nHoaDonDichVu -[hidden]down- ThanhToanDichVu\n\nNhanVienCongTy -[hidden]down- TheGiuXe\nTheGiuXe -[hidden]down- PhuongTien\n\nKiemTraPhong -[hidden]down- BienBanViPham\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 10. QUAN HE TANG VA PHONG\n&#39; ========================================\n\nTang \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; Phong : bao gồm\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 11. QUAN HE HOP DONG\n&#39; ========================================\n\nKhachHang \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; HopDong : đại diện ký\n\nCongTyThue \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; HopDong : thuê\n\nHopDong \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;1..*\&quot; ChiTietHopDong : có\n\nPhong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; ChiTietHopDong : được thuê\n\nHopDong \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;0..*\&quot; PhieuGiaHan : có\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 12. QUAN HE THANH TOAN TIEN THUE\n&#39; ========================================\n\nHopDong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; ThanhToanTienThue : thanh toán\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 13. QUAN HE DICH VU\n&#39; ========================================\n\nHopDong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; HoaDonDichVu : phát sinh\n\nHoaDonDichVu \&quot;1\&quot; *-- \&quot;1..*\&quot; ChiTietHoaDonDichVu : gồm\n\nLoaiDichVu \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; ChiTietHoaDonDichVu : áp dụng\n\nPhong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; ChiTietHoaDonDichVu : sử dụng\n\nHoaDonDichVu \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; ThanhToanDichVu : được thanh toán\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 14. QUAN HE NHAN VIEN\n&#39; ========================================\n\nCongTyThue \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; NhanVienCongTy : có\n\nPhong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; NhanVienCongTy : làm việc\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 15. QUAN HE THE GIU XE\n&#39; ========================================\n\nNhanVienCongTy \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; TheGiuXe : được cấp\n\nPhuongTien \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; TheGiuXe : đăng ký\n\n&#39; ========================================\n&#39; 16. QUAN HE KIEM TRA VA VI PHAM\n&#39; ========================================\n\nPhong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; KiemTraPhong : được kiểm tra\n\nKiemTraPhong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; BienBanViPham : ghi nhận\n\nPhong \&quot;1\&quot; -- \&quot;0..*\&quot; BienBanViPham : có vi phạm\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="QPjTI8VRvXSuJo49pEGS-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
